# Compiled per-strategy shared libraries — platform-specific build artefacts,
# regenerated locally by scripts/run_corpus.sh. The transpiler output
# (generated.cpp) is shipped in-tree so public users can rebuild without
# needing the closed-source pineforge-codegen transpiler.
**/strategy.dylib
**/strategy.so
**/strategy.dll

